# EXPECT-VIOLATION: mirash:ScalingRuleShape
#
# R5b — a ScalingRule with no multiplier. An empty scaling rule satisfies R5's minCount while
# carrying no arithmetic, so the register would LOOK decodable and still produce a raw count.

@prefix mira: <https://ontology.factorylm.com/mira#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ex:   <https://example.org/fx#> .

ex:scale_empty a mira:ScalingRule .
